"><div class=\"sppb-row-column\" id=\"column-wrap-id-4BOwlD5Jpnj-ISe1MNCQ0\"><div class=\"sppb-column\" id=\"column-id-4BOwlD5Jpnj-ISe1MNCQ0\"><div class=\"sppb-column-addons\"><div class=\"sppb-addon-wrapper\" id=\"sppb-addon-wrapper-ndqWQef7Pl7JjeYz_orgb\"><div class=\"clearfix\" id=\"sppb-addon-ndqWQef7Pl7JjeYz_orgb\"><div class=\"sppb-addon sppb-addon-text-block\"><h2 class=\"sppb-addon-title\">Join the <br/>Wilderness Trace family </h2><div class=\"sppb-addon-content\">We value the long-term relationships we build with our clients and their 4-legged best friends. We\u2019d love to welcome you into our veterinary family. Call us to book your appointment today.</div></div></div></div><div class=\"sppb-addon-wrapper\" id=\"sppb-addon-wrapper-oJ29lAYScROUoD0H99g9B\"><div class=\"clearfix\" id=\"sppb-addon-oJ29lAYScROUoD0H99g9B\"><div class=\"sppb-button-wrapper\"><a class=\"sppb-btn sppb-btn-custom sppb-btn-square\" href=\"tel:859-854-5055\" id=\"btn-oJ29lAYScROUoD0H99g9B\">Call Us Now (859) 854-5055</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sppb-section sppb-section-content-center\" id=\"section-id-1675208701889\"><div class=\"sppb-row-container\"><div class=\"sppb-row sppb-align-center\"><div class=\"sppb-row-column\" id=\"column-wrap-id-1675208701934\"><div class=\"sppb-column\" id=\"column-id-1675208701934\"><div class=\"sppb-column-addons\"><div class=\"sppb-addon-wrapper\" id=\"sppb-addon-wrapper-1675210200095\"><div class=\"clearfix\" id=\"sppb-addon-1675210200095\"><div class=\"sppb-addon sppb-addon-single-image\"><div class=\"sppb-addon-content\"><div class=\"sppb-addon-single-image-container\"><img alt=\"dog at spa wellness\" class=\"sppb-img-responsive\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/dog-at-spa-wellness.jpg\" title=\"\" width=\"960\"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"sppb-row-column\" id=\"column-wrap-id-1675208701935\"><div class=\"sppb-column\" id=\"column-id-1675208701935\"><div class=\"sppb-column-addons\"><div class=\"sppb-addon-wrapper\" id=\"sppb-addon-wrapper-QPu8_vnN7wnZUj8-Mo3Fg\"><div class=\"clearfix\" id=\"sppb-addon-QPu8_vnN7wnZUj8-Mo3Fg\"><div class=\"sppb-addon sppb-addon-text-block\"><h2 class=\"sppb-addon-title\">We See You &amp; Can Help You </h2><div class=\"sppb-addon-content\">Whether your pet has a tendency to be a diva, a fashionista, a nervous Nellie, a comedian, or a grumpy Gus, we see him or her as an individual with a unique personality. We strive to tailor our handling of your beloved friends to help them feel as comfortable and safe as possible in our care. We study your pet\u2019s symptoms and develop a treatment plan that addresses the problem and stays within your budget. We are small enough to get to know you but have the experience and equipment to take care of most illnesses, surgeries, and emergencies right here in our office. Our team excels at making sure you understand your pet\u2019s health needs and spend extra time explaining necessary treatments and procedures in simple terms. We also follow up with you to make sure your pet is responding well to the treatments. Our team can guide you through the life of your pet from early months through middle age, senior years, and geriatrics.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sppb-section sppb-hidden-xs\" id=\"section-id-tXb7d4wz_KLvSoTr7ZgRF\"><div class=\"sppb-row-container\"><div class=\"sppb-row\"><div class=\"sppb-row-column\" id=\"column-wrap-id-wsn0PRyLVpckq9yPX674O\"><div class=\"sppb-column\" id=\"column-id-wsn0PRyLVpckq9yPX674O\"><div class=\"sppb-column-addons\"><div class=\"sppb-addon-wrapper\" id=\"sppb-addon-wrapper-1675211300569\"><div class=\"clearfix\" id=\"sppb-addon-1675211300569\"><div class=\"sppb-addon sppb-addon-header\"><h2 class=\"sppb-addon-title\">We invite you and your best friend to join us at Wilderness Trace Veterinary Clinic</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"s